2026-11-07T06:43:44.7452010Z 
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7453270Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7482830Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7483980Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7484870Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7485180Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7485460Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7485850Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7486180Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7486470Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7486960Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7522880Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7524160Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7525440Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:43:44.7527020Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
